  "body": "## Snow CLI v0.9.1\n\n### What's New\n\n- Renamed `responsesFastMode` to `responsesServiceTier` with three options: Not Used (default), fast (priority), and ultrafast\n- Automatic migration from the legacy `responsesFastMode` boolean config (true migrates to `fast`)\n- Updated the Models panel to select the Responses service tier from a dedicated option list\n\n### Installation\n```bash\nnpm install -g snow-ai\n```\n\n### Usage\n```bash\nsnow\n```\n### Update\n```bash\nsnow --update\n```\n"
